  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fostering Rights and Empowerment Among Most Marginalised Adolescents and Children with Disabilities in Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall objective: To enhance the opportunities and promote the rights of children and adolescents, particularly girls and those living with disabilities. Specific Objective 1: To facilitate equitable access to social services for those in immediate need.Specific Objective 2: To empower adolescents and children with disabilities who are outside the coverage of routine social service systems, or at the risk of being dropped, to claim and access quality basic services.Specific Objective 3: To enable adolescents and children with disabilities, their families and communities to abandon discriminatory harmful practices, participate and voice their concerns and claim their rights within civic processes and local governance.</narrative>
  </description>
